    "description": "— Joe Burrow threw for three touchdowns and rushed for another and the Cincinnati Bengals' offense kept rolling to defeat the Atlanta Falcons 34-17 in Madrid on Sunday for their fourth straight win.",
    "gameId": "401873038",
    "headline": "Burrow powers Bengals past the Falcons in Madrid for their 4th straight win",
